  "sections": {
    "education": "<section class=\"relative w-full bg-white pb-24 pt-16 flex flex-col items-center\" id=\"history-2\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-12 max-w-[1000px] w-full\"><div class=\"mb-12\"><div class=\"text-[11px] text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4 font-medium pl-1 font-sans\"> Education</div><h2 class=\"font-sans text-zinc-900 text-[24px] md:text-[28px] tracking-tight font-medium mb-3\">Academic Standing</h2><p class=\"font-sans text-zinc-500 text-[13px] md:text-[14px] max-w-[800px] font-light mb-6\" style=\"word-break:keep-all\"> Rooted in academic rigor, I explore the nuances of human behavior, psychology, and cognitive science<br> to establish theoretical foundations for cutting-edge AI interactions. </p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"/research.html\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-2.5 bg-[#1a1a1a] text-white font-sans text-[13px] font-semibold rounded hover:bg-[#2a2a2a] transition-all group\"> View publications <span class=\"ml-1.5 translate-y-[1px] group-hover:translate-x-[2px] group-hover:-translate-y-[2px] transition-transform duration-300\">↗</span></a><a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=CTcwlAEAAAAJ&amp;hl=ko&amp;oi=sra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-2.5 bg-white border border-zinc-200 text-zinc-700 font-sans text-[13px] font-semibold rounded hover:bg-zinc-50 transition-all shadow-sm group\"> Google Scholar <span class=\"ml-1.5 translate-y-[1px] group-hover:translate-x-[2px] group-hover:-translate-y-[2px] transition-transform duration-300\">↗</span></a></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12\"><div class=\"flex flex-col group\"><div class=\"w-full aspect-[16/9] mb-4 overflow-hidden rounded-[10px] bg-zinc-100\"><img src=\"/original/nahyun_imported/image_source/HOME/MS.jpg\" alt=\"M.S. in Human-AI Interaction\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.03]\" style=\"object-position:center 60%\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col mt-2\"><span class=\"text-[11px] text-zinc-500 font-sans tracking-tight mb-1\">March 2021 - February 2023</span><h3 class=\"font-sans text-[#1a1a1a] text-[20px] md:text-[22px] tracking-tight font-normal mb-1\"> M.S. in Human-AI Interaction</h3><p class=\"font-sans text-zinc-500 text-[12px] flex items-center mb-6\"><svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 mr-1 text-zinc-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z\"></path><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"></path></svg> Sungkyunkwan University </p><div class=\"text-[10px] text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 font-medium\">Research Focus </div><p class=\"font-sans text-zinc-800 text-[13px] leading-[1.6]\" style=\"word-break:keep-all\">Focused on human cognition, statistical modeling, and AI technical literacy, with research published in SSCI-indexed journals.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col group\"><div class=\"w-full aspect-[16/9] mb-4 overflow-hidden rounded-[10px] bg-zinc-100\"><img src=\"/original/nahyun_imported/image_source/HOME/Sookmyung.jpg\" alt=\"B.A. in Psychology\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.03]\" style=\"object-position:center 35%\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col mt-2\"><span class=\"text-[11px] text-zinc-500 font-sans tracking-tight mb-1\">March 2015 - February 2021</span><h3 class=\"font-sans text-[#1a1a1a] text-[20px] md:text-[22px] tracking-tight font-normal mb-1\"> B.A. in Psychology</h3><p class=\"font-sans text-zinc-500 text-[12px] flex items-center mb-6\"><svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 mr-1 text-zinc-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z\"></path><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"></path></svg> Sookmyung Women's University </p><div class=\"text-[10px] text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 font-medium\">Additional Degree</div><p class=\"font-sans text-zinc-800 text-[13px] leading-[1.6] mb-6\"> Double major in ESG Management<br> Minor in Business Administration </p><div class=\"text-[10px] text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 font-medium\">Research Focus </div><p class=\"font-sans text-zinc-800 text-[13px] leading-[1.6]\"> Built core expertise in behavioral research, experimental design, and quantitative analytics, grounding future UX practices. </p></div></div></div></div></section>",
    "principles": "<section class=\"how-i-work-section bg-[#fafafa] pt-16 pb-32 md:pt-24 md:pb-48\" id=\"how-work\"><div class=\"container\"><div data-reading-role=\"qualification-section-header\" class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center mb-16 md:mb-24 max-w-[1000px] mx-auto px-4\"><h2 class=\"font-sans text-zinc-900 text-[28px] md:text-[36px] tracking-tight font-medium mb-5 leading-[1.15]\"> Core principles driving<br> next-gen AI products. </h2><p class=\"font-sans text-zinc-600 text-[15px] md:text-[18px] font-light leading-[1.6] max-w-full mx-auto\" style=\"word-break:keep-all\"> Driving scalable product lifecycles through persuasive storytelling, empathic alignment, and relentless efficiency.<br> I unite engineering and strategy to translate ambiguous technical possibilities into user-centric realities. </p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 lg:gap-6 w-full max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white border border-zinc-200 shadow-sm rounded-[16px] p-5 lg:p-6 group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300\"><h3 class=\"font-sans text-[22px] font-medium leading-[1.2] text-zinc-900 mb-2\">Persuasive Storytelling</h3><p class=\"font-sans text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-zinc-500 mb-4 shrink-0\">Crafting narratives through analysis and writing. Enabling confident decision-making across teams and stakeholders through alignment-driven writing.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mb-6 mt-auto\"><span class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold text-zinc-600 bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200/60 rounded-[4px] tracking-wide uppercase\">Published Writing</span><span class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold text-zinc-600 bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200/60 rounded-[4px] tracking-wide uppercase\">Data Conviction</span></div><div class=\"w-full aspect-video rounded-[8px] overflow-hidden shrink-0 relative bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-100/50\"><img src=\"/original/how_work_story_new_169.png\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\"></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white border border-zinc-200 shadow-sm rounded-[16px] p-5 lg:p-6 group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300\"><h3 class=\"font-sans text-[22px] font-medium leading-[1.2] text-zinc-900 mb-2\">Efficiency-Driven </h3><p class=\"font-sans text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-zinc-500 mb-4 shrink-0\">Focused on one clear goal driving it to resolution. Establishes a plan early from signals, aligns communication and resources to remove friction.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mb-6 mt-auto\"><span class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold text-zinc-600 bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200/60 rounded-[4px] tracking-wide uppercase\">Deliver Results</span><span class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold text-zinc-600 bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200/60 rounded-[4px] tracking-wide uppercase\">Experiment &amp; Iterate</span></div><div class=\"w-full aspect-video rounded-[8px] overflow-hidden shrink-0 relative bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-100/50\"><img src=\"/original/how_work_efficiency_new_169.png\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover \"></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white border border-zinc-200 shadow-sm rounded-[16px] p-5 lg:p-6 group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300\"><h3 class=\"font-sans text-[22px] font-medium leading-[1.2] text-zinc-900 mb-2\">Communication Architect</h3><p class=\"font-sans text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-zinc-500 mb-4 shrink-0\">Facilitating alignment through transparent systems. Automates coordination and builds rapport, enabling issues to surface early.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mb-6 mt-auto\"><span class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold text-zinc-600 bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200/60 rounded-[4px] tracking-wide uppercase\">Cross-functional</span><span class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold text-zinc-600 bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200/60 rounded-[4px] tracking-wide uppercase\">Psychology-informed</span></div><div class=\"w-full aspect-video rounded-[8px] overflow-hidden shrink-0 relative bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-100/50\"><img src=\"/original/how_work_comm_new_169.png\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\"></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col bg-white border border-zinc-200 shadow-sm rounded-[16px] p-5 lg:p-6 group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300\"><h3 class=\"font-sans text-[22px] font-medium leading-[1.2] text-zinc-900 mb-2\"> Inquiry-Driven<br>Detection</h3><p class=\"font-sans text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-zinc-500 mb-4 shrink-0\">Actively uncovering signals through inquiry. Gathers perspectives from first-hand field insights, interviews, and industry seminars.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mb-6 mt-auto\"><span class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold text-zinc-600 bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200/60 rounded-[4px] tracking-wide uppercase\">Field-driven Insights</span><span class=\"inline-block px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold text-zinc-600 bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200/60 rounded-[4px] tracking-wide uppercase\">Trend Analysis</span></div><div class=\"w-full aspect-video rounded-[8px] overflow-hidden shrink-0 relative bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-100/50\"><img src=\"/original/how_work_detect_new_169.png\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\"></div></div></div></div></section>",
